{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"paid\" \"free\" \"value it more\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_999975030#22_1956463739","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q3918","rank":1,"snippet":"Flashcards. 6. Word of the Day Email Lessons Click here to get the Korean Word of the Day. Korean Word of the Day App Grammar 9. Learn-Korean.Net Other “Less Serious” Resources 9. YouTube 10. Podcasts The good news is that… Yes, you can learn Korean online free. \" , \"segment\": \"You need to put in effort. You can have a wonderful free resource and not use it. The result is, you won’t learn any Korean. The downside of <cover>free material, as I wrote here, is that you don’t value it as much. But, if you paid $40 or $100 for a resource, you’d value it more… </cover>because you had to lose something (money) to gain it. But, that doesn’t mean you can’t learn Korean online free. You just need to put in effort. Cool? So, pick at least one resource and use the hell out of it. – The Main Lingua Junkie\" , \"start_char\": 5469.000000 , \"title\": \"How to Learn Korean for Free Online. 10+ Ways\" , \"url\": \"https://www.linguajunkie.com/korean-"}}
