{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_999975030#22_1956463739","relevance":2,"reason":"The passage directly says the downside of free material is that people do not value it as much, while paying $40 or $100 makes them value it more because they had to lose money to gain it. This is strong direct support, but the document is mainly a list of free Korean-learning resources rather than a dedicated explanation of why free things have lower perceived value.","learned":"A useful explanation is loss/commitment: paying money creates sacrifice and investment, which makes people value the resource more than if it were free."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"you don't value it as much\" free paid money)","reason":"Search the exact promising wording with paid/money terms to find similar or more dedicated explanations that free resources are valued less because no money is sacrificed."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"you don't value it as much\" free paid money)"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_999975030#21_1956462185","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3919","rank":2,"snippet":"Podcasts The good news is that… Yes, you can learn Korean online free. \" , \"segment\": \"The benefit of podcasts is that you can listen in your downtime, while you relax at home. Very easy to take in. But of course, unless you’re listening and writing things down, you won’t learn much just by listening alone. The good news is that… Yes, you can learn Korean online free. But as with all things in life, it all depends on you. You need to put in effort. You can have a wonderful free resource and not use it. The result is, you won’t learn any Korean. The downside of <cover>free material, as I wrote here, is that you don’t value it as much. But, if you paid $40 or $100 for a resource, you’d value it more… because you had to lose something (money) </cover>to gain it.\" , \"start_char\": 5129.000000 , \"title\": \"How to Learn Korean for Free Online. 10+ Ways\" , \"url\": \"https://www.linguajunkie.com/korean-2/learn-korean-online-free\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_999975030#22_1956463739","rank":1,"relevance":2}]}}
