{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_37_748624439#3_1539987039","relevance":3,"reason":"The passage is directly about free versus paid dating sites and explains why the free option has less value: paid users have 'skin in the game,' are more serious/committed, and free users have little to lose. This is strong direct evidence for the perceived-value mechanism.","learned":"Free offerings can be perceived as less valuable because recipients/users have no financial commitment, so they may be less serious, less invested, and have less to lose."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3910","reason":"The 'skin in the game' query is producing the strongest direct evidence, including multiple passages explaining lower value of free things through lack of commitment; continue this result list."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3910"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_37_574863340#17_1237311365","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3910","rank":5,"snippet":"and Lineup Tools PGA – Golf eSports Stats and Tools News and Player Info Types of Tools: About These Tools Should you use one of these tools/service? \" , \"segment\": \"That will not, has not and will probably never work over the long haul. You have to put in the work to build your team. The optimizers can help you do that faster. You can use tools to help you build teams, find <cover>value and target players and stacking combinations that you might not have thought of. My #1 favorite free tool I always is the always up to date NFL Odds and Lines. Let the bookies do the heavy lifting. They do have skin in the game </cover>so you can expect them to give you excellent insight into what the true experts think about the upcoming game. Don’t just think buying access to any one optimizer, projections service or even the touts selling lineups that you will easily win money. It’s not going to happen. You still have to build your team, find value and put in your own research.\" , \"start_char\": 7959.000000 , \""}}
